<title>USA: FSA qualifies five bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies five bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday that it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--ST. Charles, Ill., $5 million General Obligations.</p>
<p>--N.E. Johnson County CFD, Kan., $2.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Garden City, Mich., $9.935 million special assessment.</p>
<p>--Chittenango CSD, N.Y., $4.125 million school district GOs.</p>
<p>--Cottage Grove, Wis., $2.15 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
